{
  "date": "2026-10-31",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "今年1至9月，江苏的跨境移动支付金额是21.6亿元，比去年同期多42.6%",
  "title_en": "This year from January to September, cross-border mobile payments in Jiangsu came to 2.16 billion yuan, up 42.6% on the same period last year",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "10月30日，中国人民银行江苏省分行开了新闻发布会，介绍江苏怎样改善外国人和老年人的支付服务。",
      "en": "On October 30, the Jiangsu Provincial Branch of the People's Bank of China held a press conference on how Jiangsu is improving payment services for foreigners and elderly people."
    },
    {
      "zh": "1至9月，江苏的外币兑换、外国银行卡取现、外国银行卡刷卡，还有跨境移动支付，金额一共是43.5亿元，比去年同期增长32.2%。其中，跨境移动支付的金额是21.6亿元，增长42.6%。",
      "en": "From January to September, foreign currency exchange, cash withdrawals with foreign bank cards, payments with foreign bank cards and cross-border mobile payments in Jiangsu totalled 4.35 billion yuan, up 32.2% on the same period last year. Of this, cross-border mobile payments came to 2.16 billion yuan, up 42.6%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "到9月底，可以刷外国银行卡的重点商户有3.9万家。外国银行卡取现的金额是8.7亿元，增长22.5%；外币兑换的金额增长12.7%。",
      "en": "By the end of September, 39,000 key merchants could accept foreign bank cards. Cash withdrawals with foreign bank cards came to 870 million yuan, up 22.5%, and the amount of foreign currency exchanged grew 12.7%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "为了方便老年人，全省约5.4万台ATM已经改造好，1.3万多个银行网点开通了“绿色通道”。另外，江苏还为亚太经合组织的贸易部长会议和其他活动提供了支付服务保障。",
      "en": "To make things easier for elderly people, about 54,000 ATMs across the province have been upgraded, and more than 13,000 bank branches have opened a \"green channel\". In addition, Jiangsu provided payment service support for the APEC trade ministers' meeting and other events."
    }
  ],
